    <itunes:duration>00:58:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIKv1W7czHIx_TKecN1ORAVs_so.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>因为要“上班”，这期差点录不完...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ca8abc0766616acd3cd33f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ca8abc0766616acd3cd33f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期别叫聚焦职场。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当Z世代进入职场，是整顿职场，还是被职场整顿？</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位主播，一位热爱工作甘愿为KPI献祭周末；另一位面对职场蛐蛐、濒临辞职边缘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当天选打工人PK职场老帮菜，二位主播展开了一场对【职场本质】的深度讨论和激情“对辩”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力工作跪舔老板是卷王还是工贼？</span></p><span></span><p><span>职场演戏是自我pua，还是游戏规则？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当职场霸凌披上”为你好”的外衣，如何识别并反击？</span></p><span></span><p><span>无聊感是工作的宿命，还是被驯化后的结果？</span></p><span></span><p><span>人就不能不工作吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切精彩，尽在别叫。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Terrance &amp; Jesse</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：</span><em><span>Too Marvelous for Words</span></em><span> by Lester Young</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsyWNRW1e6j1EHi6yT-AbWqvfquk.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654c68245ae1d66b7444cb7e/lgdp5FEQXOxYupKY713mXbyOeWZi.m4a" length="49565853" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:23</itunes:duration>
