  <item>
    <title>为了性魅力而焦虑的一生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676629261e823e72d3874a44</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676629261e823e72d3874a44</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期别叫持续辛辣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着社交媒体、交友软件的风靡，“性魅力”已经从过去的禁忌转变为如今随处可见的热词。无论男女，我们好像都在烦恼自己的“性魅力”还不够多。从大众消费到社会心理，“性魅力”其实也投射了各个阶层、各种身份的人对于自我认可的各种想象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在几乎所有人都在为“性魅力”而奔命的当下，我们到底要如何面对这样一个隐藏在面纱之下的问题？你曾为“性魅力”焦虑过吗？又“性魅力”做出过哪些努力？每次谈及这种话题背后的羞耻感与恐惧感到底暗示了什么？所有精彩，都在本期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期问题：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 焦虑“性魅力”：从学生到成人，为何焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 追求“性魅力”：为何有人焦虑，有人自洽？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 解构“性魅力”：身材+颜值+XX，性魅力真能被拆解？</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 溯源“性魅力”：过分追求背后是渴求认可还是补偿心态？</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 透析“性魅力”：性魅力是为了讨好还是被讨好？</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 批判“性魅力”：我一定要时刻保持性感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>7. 点缀“性魅力”：幽默和性魅力究竟互斥吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Terrance &amp; Jesse</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：My Favorite Things by John Coltrane</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fss3YCzuF0344SVtxtoV0aTEPPgV.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhbhzUsAl3LGMxtJQl2aMogxLl3D.m4a" length="46624969" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftj4axsH2lcZVc63UXdDZ1juTGVT.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从哈里斯败选到曲曲大女人，对话亚太区最值得交往华人女</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67304742f373fe5d4d0d1b4e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67304742f373fe5d4d0d1b4e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Nov 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>别叫第二十期 聚焦时事+女权话题，邀请到了近期圈平台太蹿红的</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5999f44f5e87e745773cf39b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e9d9b130000000001001890&amp;apptime=1731216020&amp;share_id=728a67392f5b41aaad6c9abadd8901eb" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5999f44f5e87e745773cf39b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e9d9b130000000001001890&amp;apptime=1731216020&amp;share_id=728a67392f5b41aaad6c9abadd8901eb"><span>亚太区最值得交往华人女</span></a><span>！（请支持她的播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/652ca7810432a315786c4c53" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/652ca7810432a315786c4c53"><span>只说一遍 SAY NO MORE</span></a><span>)</span></p><span></span><p><span>从美国大选的红蓝对抗到近期国内的舆论事件，看似毫无关联的时事却纷纷导向了性别的战场。性别议题已经从娱乐新闻渗透到了商业话题甚至时事政治。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因此，我们从“女权”话题出发，探讨了诸多存在争议且悬而未决的问题：特朗普/哈里斯/杨笠/京东/曲曲大女人/刘晓庆/杨天真……</span></p><span></span><p><span>思想交流之快，信息密度之高，持续别叫……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听时点：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> Trump 获胜后的时事评论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 从美国大选到性别战场 （对美国时事不感兴趣的听众请从此开始收听）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 女权主义者可以吃麻六记吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 杨笠可以代言京东吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 你看过“曲曲大女人”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 为什么强势的男性却害怕性别对立？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> 女权主义者如何对待在男权社会中如鱼得水的女性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 我支持女权，那我还能爱男人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 大女人注定要成为大男人吗？真正的大女人模版究竟有谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a> 女权阵营内部也在不断划分敌我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> “男性注定无法理解女性”背后的悖论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> 如果“男权女”存在，那么“女权男”存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> 女权的胜利到底和男性有没有关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 生活中最女权的小事</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmx8zvOI1jcmrf7PqYTrEFOsErsi.m4a" length="101650049" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm3SroiD-K0BO7ZIujQ15KcCZHHg.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
